{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d850ad9f0fc152fffa21c9b567e06b3aa0e1b3df367cb7a8022b4851c3b6c2ff","ja":"ケガの功名？","zh":"因祸得福？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8db97c012b062f75f0035ffc133c9a3399e00d15df8c135d8291b05e0742610b","ja":"数日後、歌織と紬は、バラエティ番組の企画で\n子どもたちと公園に来ていて……","zh":"几天后，歌织和紬因为综艺节目的企划，\n正和孩子们一起来到公园……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2f68e3f5470ead2bb30a00ccfd429a83e308ab7355f1befb44fa8171019d4b8b","ja":"さあ、そろそろ幼稚園に戻る時間よ。\nみんな、ここに集まってね～！","zh":"好了，差不多到回幼儿园的时间了。\n大家快集合到这里来～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"04f9f1e8a7e8a30c627360807656ceaeb0f1f0a4bf827c829b1db8b8f1474429","ja":"……えっ、まだ帰りたくない？　そうですか……\n特別なものをお見せしようと思っていたのですが。","zh":"……咦，还不想回去吗？这样啊……\n本来还想让您看样特别的东西呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"6983e22f3c7ecc15c3a9924f9ad30c691a59acbdda1de7b5f523b794180b085d","ja":"気になりますか？　三味線、という楽器です。\nふふ。どんな音色か、楽しみにしていてくださいね。","zh":"您很在意吗？这件乐器叫做三味线。\n呵呵。敬请期待它会发出怎样的音色吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a87a7d9af3deb6c48ccee26dbd2b770c8ac456ab0d2775bfb6a419a5a544b158","ja":"幼稚園に戻っても、一緒にたくさん遊びましょうね～♪","zh":"回幼儿园之后，也要一起好好玩耍哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"b8816997c778572d69511412559a489b43874d5cc3464cfb7540771897a0e4e0","ja":"紬ちゃん、お疲れさま！\n子どもたちへの接し方、とっても良かったわよ♪","zh":"小紬，辛苦啦！\n你对待孩子们的方式，非常棒哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"c887ab0bcae7a76ba3d391f57b15a54f0f6d151f4eee0fce1432ec9830b169c0","ja":"本当ですか？　できれば本当に、桜守さんのような\n話し方を身に付けたかったのですが……。","zh":"真的吗？如果可以的话，我原本真的很想\n学会像樱守小姐那样的说话方式的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4ed50917f93a5957d285bea5fd092665af72ed64f5cd9399d8ba493c615498f8","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーの盗み聞きが誤解だったと\nわかって、なんだか気恥ずかしくなってしまい……。","zh":"●●●●弄清是误会了制作人在偷听之后，\n总觉得有些害羞起来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"413843e716aad23c16241c95f4f1438228a19b4dcf080726bd38e20c30291388","ja":"でも結果的には、子どもたちと楽しく遊べたんだから\nよかったんじゃないかしら♪","zh":"不过结果也能和小孩子们开开心心地玩耍，\n不也是挺好的嘛♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d004e11884d44e068ae751b3d9a8979646dced6bc08e001037e0c4059e14fbaf","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーさんのおかげで、\n自然体の紬ちゃんに戻れたのね。","zh":"多亏了制作人，\n紬才恢复到自然的状态呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3a22a3b8e42fe6aa4f9cb3acd22443e987158888f3fa1e74c3526a1ff4db15f1","ja":"そ、そうでしょうか……？","zh":"是、是这样吗……？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1241.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a19b74425de9ab54aa109b6c434b8b2cdd342997af1d9501573a8f6a87f7e055","ja":"ですが手放しに感謝するというのも……はぁ。\nとても複雑な気持ちです……。","zh":"但是要我坦率地向他道谢……唉。\n心情真是非常复杂……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
